  "notes": "Boot a No Fear ROM from an empty NVRAM with the coin door open (public 22 released); the scenario names no game. Leave the fresh-NVRAM BOOKKEEPING TOTALS CLEARED loop with Escape (5), press Enter twice (game identification, then MAIN MENU), Up twice to T. TESTS and Enter to open the test menu at T.1 SWITCH EDGES. Run it with PinMAME's built-in mechanisms disabled (--handle-mechanics 0), as the known-working table does; nfGameData declares none. Open T.16 BALL ACCELERATOR TEST, which starts with all three ramp magnets enabled and LEFT selected. Pulse the left ramp opto 46 (public 1, 150 ms), disable LEFT with Enter and pulse 46, 47 and 48 in turn, then select and disable CENTER and pulse 47 and 48, then select and disable RIGHT and pulse 48, and finally enable RIGHT again and pulse 48, recording which public solenoid the ROM fires on each opto edge.",
  "version": 1
